          "images": [
            "https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202404/bg2024040401.webp"
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Suno AI",
          "content": "<p>Suno AI 是一个“文生音乐”的服务。网友的<a href=\"https://sunoprompt.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">这个工具</a>帮助你生成它的提示词，可以调整各种细节。（<a href=\"https://github.com/ruanyf/weekly/issues/4194\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@Lcorinst</a> 投稿）</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202404/bg2024040305.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>另有一个 <a href=\"https://sunoaidownload.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Suno AI 音乐下载器</a>。（<a href=\"https://github.com/ruanyf/weekly/issues/4250\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@AICodeHunt</a> 投稿）</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202404/bg2024041104.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>",
